# In a 40x10 terminal, G in a long Upcoming list scrolls to the last entry with its day heading above it, and gg scrolls back to Tomorrow.
size 40 10
file <<END
- A1 @due({today+1})
- A2 @due({today+1})
- B1 @due({today+2})
- B2 @due({today+2})
- C1 @due({today+3})
- C2 @due({today+3})
- D1 @due({today+7})
END
keys gU G
see ▌ - D1
see Next
hide Tomorrow ·
keys gg
see Tomorrow ·
see ▌ - A1
